# Build-time configuration for the native shells (Capacitor / Tauri).
#
# Loaded by `vite build --mode native`, which the `build:native` script runs. In a
# browser tab the SPA is served BY the Worker, so relative `/api/...` paths are already
# correct and this file is not used at all. In a native shell the SPA is served from the
# shell's own local origin, where a relative path would resolve against a server that
# does not exist — so the Worker origin has to be baked in.
#
# This is a public URL, not a secret. The bearer token is entered at runtime and lives
# in localStorage; nothing credential-bearing belongs in this file.
VITE_API_BASE=https://tessera.ivanderseah08.workers.dev
